//   1. HTTP route /silverhand-pet/spritesheet.webp (raw decoded bytes, cached).
//   2. RPC getSprite -> data:image/webp;base64,... (fallback).
//   3. RPC getState -> the pet's current state derived from agent events.
//
// This file is a plain-JavaScript Cordis plugin BODY evaluated as the body of
// an async function. Available Host builtins: ctx, harness, console,
// btoa/atob (UTF-8 text), TextEncoder, TextDecoder — plus any service declared
// in `inject`. There is no require/process/Buffer/fetch/native timer.

